{"speciesId":691,"names":{"fr":"Kravarech","es":"Dragalge","en":"Dragalge","ja":"ドラミドロ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il asperge tous ceux qui osent pénétrer sur son territoire d’un poison assez corrosif pour dissoudre la coque d’un pétrolier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Ataca de manera indiscriminada a quien ose adentrarse en su territorio, escupiéndole un virulento veneno que puede corroer hasta el casco de un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their poison is strong enough to eat through the hull of a tanker, and they spit it indiscriminately at anything that enters their territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"タンカーの 船体を 腐らせる 猛毒を 縄張りに 入りこんだ ものに 見境なく 吐きかける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il paraît que les navires qui s’aventurent dans les eaux peuplées de Kravarech ne reviennent jamais de leur périple."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Según se dice, los barcos que se aventuran en aguas donde habitan Dragalge desaparecen del mapa y no regresan a puerto."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ドラミドロが 住む 海域に 迷いこんだ 船は ２度と 生きて 戻れないと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il asperge tous ceux qui osent pénétrer sur son territoire d’un poison assez corrosif pour dissoudre la coque d’un pétrolier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ataca de manera indiscriminada a quien ose adentrarse en su territorio, escupiéndole un virulento veneno que puede corroer hasta el casco de un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Their poison is strong enough to eat through the hull of a tanker, and they spit it indiscriminately at anything that enters their territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"タンカーの 船体を 腐らせる 猛毒を 縄張りに 入りこんだ ものに 見境なく 吐きかける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il paraît que les navires qui s’aventurent dans les eaux peuplées de Kravarech ne reviennent jamais de leur périple."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Según se dice, los barcos que se aventuran en aguas donde habitan Dragalge desaparecen del mapa y no regresan a puerto."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ドラミドロが 住む 海域に 迷いこんだ 船は ２度と 生きて 戻れないと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les étourdis qui divaguent du côté de chez lui se font chasser à grands jets de poison. Curieusement, il adore Sinistrail."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este violento Pokémon escupe veneno a los rivales que se le acercan. Sin embargo, por algún extraño motivo, se lleva muy bien con Dhelmise."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This vicious Pokémon sprays a poisonous liquid on opponents that come near. For whatever reason, it gets along really well with Dhelmise."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"凶暴で 寄ってきた 相手に 毒液を 吹きかける。 なぜだか ダダリンとだけは とっても 仲良し。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il attend sa proie tapi au milieu des algues, et attaque en crachant un poison si corrosif qu’il peut même dissoudre le métal."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se esconde entre las algas y espera a sus presas, a las cuales rocía con un veneno tan cáustico que puede derretir hasta el metal."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It blends in with seaweed to ambush its prey and then takes them down with a poisonous liquid strong enough to melt metal."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"海藻に まぎれて 獲物を 待ち 金属を 溶かすほどの 毒液を 吹きかけて 仕留めるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Avec son poison capable de dissoudre le métal, il réduit à l’état d’épave les navires-citernes qui pénètrent sur son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Utiliza su veneno capaz de corroer el metal para enviar a pique cualquier navío que ose adentrarse en las aguas que habita."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Dragalge uses a poisonous liquid capable of corroding metal to send tankers that enter its territory to the bottom of the sea."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"金属を 腐らせる 毒液で 縄張りに 入りこんだ タンカーを 海の藻屑に してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il sort la crête sur sa tête à la surface de l’eau et l’expose à la lumière du soleil pour produire de l’énergie draconique."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Asoma la cresta de la cabeza sobre la superficie del agua y transforma la luz que absorbe del sol en energía dragón."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Dragalge generates dragon energy by sticking the plume on its head out above the ocean’s surface and bathing it in sunlight."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"頭の 笠を 海面から 出し 太陽の 光を 浴びることで ドラゴンエネルギーを 作るのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":691,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"acid","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[15,"level-up",42],[16,"level-up",42],[17,"level-up",42],[18,"level-up",42],[20,"level-up",59],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",59],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":